#ASSERT `the vintage reproduces the provision the SimpLEX case cites` `the SimpLEX draft of the Fees Regulations` `, reading the case as` (`the SimpLEX reading that takes the draft's regulation 4 as regulation 4 as made`) `, the case being` (`SimpLEX row 8, a practical exam`)
